OL,3,GNEWSAHeart hospital worker has heart
OL,4,Aattack on shift
OL,5,
OL,6,FA switchboard call handler at Liverpool
OL,7,FHeart and Chest Hospital (LHCH) has
OL,8,Fdescribed having a heart attack at work
OL,9,Fas being like "a bad dream".
OL,11,FPat Ward, 70, has worked for the
OL,12,Fhospital for almost 50 years and was
OL,13,Ftaking a taxi to work when she began to
OL,14,Ffeel unwell last year.
OL,16,FBy the time she got to work, her jaw
OL,17,Fand chest pain had worsened. Pat said:
OL,18,F"I felt like my chest was caving in"
OL,19,Fand told her colleague she thought she
OL,20,Fwas having a heart attack.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
